    "common_core": "Use the triplet-relaxed R_H Cu2O8C4 carboxylate core and both axial N positions as the shared frozen coordinate set. Map exactly these atoms, retain all ligands and relax remaining coordinates consistently. Report held and released coordinates. Alternative equivalent common-core choices require the same full three-member comparison.",
